        "r": 291.3881000000004,
        "b": 618.4301492035388
      },
      "content": "This section contains troubleshooting information for  the  HDKAG  generator  and  voltage  regulator. Make the following visual checks before starting:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_405",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6. Generator Set/Regulator Troubleshooting"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_405",
          "title": "GENERAL"
        }
      ],
      "page": 33,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0389",
      "reading_order": 407,
      "section": "GENERAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.4095,
        "t": 606.9003068359375,
        "r": 291.6129,
        "b": 569.3903492035388
      },
      "content": " Check any modification or repair that was done since the last satisfactory operation of the set. Verify that it was done properly.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_405",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6. Generator Set/Regulator Troubleshooting"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_405",
          "title": "GENERAL"
        }
      ],
      "page": 33,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0390",
      "reading_order": 408,
      "section": "GENERAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.4095,
        "t": 557.8610068359375,
        "r": 291.39290000000034,
        "b": 495.0664492035388
      },
      "content": " Check  to  see  that  generator  leads  are  connected correctly.  Also check the voltage regulator  and  control  component  connectors.    A loose, contaminated, or misplaced wire connection can be detected by close inspection.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_405",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6. Generator Set/Regulator Troubleshooting"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_405",
          "title": "GENERAL"
        }
      ],
      "page": 33,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0391",
      "reading_order": 409,
      "section": "GENERAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.4095,
        "t": 483.5933068359375,
        "r": 291.42699999999985,
        "b": 433.4410492035388
      },
      "content": " Check for an open circuit breaker.  If the breaker is open, check for an overloaded circuit and correct  load  problems  before  resetting  the breaker.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_405",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
